---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Agentic Systems — Tools for Agents That Remember" description="Builder-facing tools from the AIIT stack: memory, evaluation, browser control, and voice. Some are products. Some are community modules. All came out of production agents.">

<section style="padding-top: 160px; min-height: 80vh;">
  <div class="container narrow" style="max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 8vw;">

    <div class="eyebrow">Agentic Systems</div>
    <h1 style="font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 4.5rem); margin-bottom: 20px; line-height: 1.1;">
      tools for agents that<br>remember, browse, and<br>answer under pressure.
    </h1>
    <p class="ag-lede">
      These are the builder-facing pieces of the AIIT stack: memory, evaluation, browser control, and voice.
      Some are products. Some are community modules. All of them came out of production agents.
    </p>

    <!-- VIDEO REVEAL -->
    <div class="ag-video-wrap">
      <button class="ag-video-btn" id="ag-video-toggle" onclick="document.getElementById('ag-video-panel').hidden=!document.getElementById('ag-video-panel').hidden;this.textContent=document.getElementById('ag-video-panel').hidden?'Watch the AI say the quiet part →':'Close'">Watch the AI say the quiet part →</button>
      <div id="ag-video-panel" hidden class="ag-video-panel">
        <video controls preload="none" style="width:100%;border-radius:8px;">
          <source src="/agentic/AiReveal.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
        </video>
        <p class="ag-video-caption">The face is generated. The voice is generated. The point is not.<br><em>AI output depends on the structure, context, constraints, examples, and judgment of the human driving it.</em></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CARDS -->
    <div class="ag-grid">

      <div class="ag-card">
        <div class="ag-badge ag-badge-scale">Sliding scale</div>
        <div class="ag-icon">🧠</div>
        <h2 class="ag-title">LAC Memory Kit</h2>
        <div class="ag-subtitle">Persistent memory for agents.</div>
        <p class="ag-body">
          14-tier memory, self-save → review → promote, voice tier, keeper-disjunction, and Gary's Browser.
          Drop into any LLM project in 60 seconds. Production code, not a prototype.
        </p>
        <a href="/lac" class="ag-cta">Get the kit →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="ag-card">
        <div class="ag-badge ag-badge-live">Live</div>
        <div class="ag-icon">⚓</div>
        <h2 class="ag-title">AnchorForge</h2>
        <div class="ag-subtitle">Honesty under pressure.</div>
        <p class="ag-body">
          Eval and pressure-test agent behavior, refusal boundaries, and identity stability.
          Physics-first claim adjudication — not fact-checking, not debunking. Coherence evaluation.
        </p>
        <a href="/anchorforge" class="ag-cta">Open AnchorForge →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="ag-card">
        <div class="ag-badge ag-badge-scale">$50</div>
        <div class="ag-icon">🎙️</div>
        <h2 class="ag-title">AIIT-Voice2</h2>
        <div class="ag-subtitle">Interruptible voice engine.</div>
        <p class="ag-body">
          Talk over your AI like a person. Barge-in detection, floor management, validated state machine, Whisper ASR, Piper TTS. 2,300 lines of engine code. Includes support.
        </p>
        <a href="/voice2" class="ag-cta">Get Voice2 →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="ag-card">
        <div class="ag-badge ag-badge-scale">$5/printer</div>
        <div class="ag-icon">🖨️</div>
        <h2 class="ag-title">wAIste Not</h2>
        <div class="ag-subtitle">AI print formation.</div>
        <p class="ag-body">
          AI has no eyes. wAIste Not is the pre-print verification layer — grid calibration, brand-locked templates, offline forever. $5 per printer, one-time.
        </p>
        <a href="/waiste" class="ag-cta">Get wAIste Not →</a>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- PROOFDESK CALLOUT -->
    <div style="margin-top: 24px; padding: 24px; border-left: 3px solid rgba(212,164,55,0.3); background: rgba(212,164,55,0.04); border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;">
      <p style="color: var(--slate); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
        Looking for proof operations instead of tools? <a href="/proofdesk" style="color: var(--amber); font-weight: 600;">AnchorForge ProofDesk →</a> — sealed evidence packets for inventors, founders, and attorneys. $149–$1,999.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- BOTTOM -->
    <div class="ag-bottom">
      <p>
        Everything here was built by one person, a 3090, and a stack of Claude sessions in Council Hill, Oklahoma.
        If you build something with these tools — <a href="mailto:reliablerestaurantrepair@gmail.com" style="color: var(--amber);">tell us about it</a>.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .ag-lede {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.15rem);
    color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 56px;
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .ag-video-wrap {
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .ag-video-btn {
    background: none;
    border: 1px solid rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.4);
    color: #a78bfa;
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    padding: 12px 28px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s;
  }

  .ag-video-btn:hover {
    background: rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.1);
    color: #c4b5fd;
  }

  .ag-video-panel {
    margin-top: 20px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.15);
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 4px;
  }

  .ag-video-caption {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .ag-video-caption em {
    color: var(--amber, #D4AF37);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .ag-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 64px;
  }

  .ag-card {
    position: relative;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.15);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 32px 24px 28px;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
  }

  .ag-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.4);
    box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.08);
  }

  .ag-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 16px;
    right: 16px;
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .ag-badge-scale {
    background: rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.15);
    color: var(--amber, #D4AF37);
  }

  .ag-badge-live {
    background: rgba(64, 192, 176, 0.15);
    color: #40c0b0;
  }

  .ag-badge-exp {
    background: rgba(138, 154, 181, 0.15);
    color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5);
  }

  .ag-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .ag-title {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: var(--cream, #E8E0D4);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .ag-subtitle {
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--amber, #D4AF37);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .ag-body {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .ag-cta {
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--amber, #D4AF37);
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.3);
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .ag-cta:hover {
    color: #fff;
  }

  .ag-bottom {
    padding: 32px 0 80px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.1);
  }

  .ag-bottom p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
</style>

</Layout>
